Dr. Traum's Research Journal Entry

Materials for sample harvesting:

- Inhalation anesthesia (ether & cyclopropane)

- Scalpel

- Syringe

- Vials

The sample I harvested yesterday from the individual proved faulty. I need to be more precise when choosing samples.

The process took too long, not enough volume and the heart rate of the patient increased during operation. Might be due to patients old age and a lack of sterile environment.

I can't go back to the same person, next one should be someone else... 